Accept three-digit compute capabilities

The capability validator checks for exactly two digits, so 12.0 is rejected
and the build stops during repository setup. Consumer Blackwell is sm_120.
Datacenter Blackwell is sm_100 and cannot run sm_120 PTX, so a mixed fleet
needs both.
